    <string name="section_privacy">Privacy statement</string>
    <string name="privacy_text">Your notes belong to you and stay on this device. Titles and note text are encrypted with a key held in the Android Keystore, and your password is stored only as a salted hash, never as plain text. Notes are never uploaded. The app uses the internet only to load a daily quote, which sends no personal data. Backups are saved encrypted in the private storage of this app, which other apps cannot read. Uninstalling the app removes all of this data.</string>

